  + [proof_route] type signature and static raw/bare-input rejection

& [M2B-SOTIDR-003] is current independent rederivation
  + [support] left then right plan-and-assembly clones pass prerequisite transform and complete equality
  + [proof_route] success through distinct complete carriers, complete operand equality check, static call-order check, contradiction seam, and side-qualified nested-fault relation tests

& [M2B-SOTIDR-004] is exact profile scope
  + [support] result, encoding, retained-plan, and assembly profiles equal current constants on both sides
  + [proof_route] static exact-role assertions plus safe success construction only through opaque prerequisite outputs; invalid opaque carriers are not fabricated

& [M2B-SOTIDR-005] is exact limits scope
  + [support] complete TopologyScanLimits equality only
  + [proof_route] perturb every one of seven limit fields and reject before relation release

