  + [proof_route] swapped unequal and lineage-distinct equal operands

& [M2B-SOTIDR-010] is closed atomic fault
  + [support] exact code-side-nested relation and bounded diagnostics with no partial result
  + [proof_route] every code, invalid relation where constructible, bound, Display, and serialization tests

& [M2B-SOTIDR-011] is evidence-grade vocabulary
  + [support] supplied comparable Equal or Different only; temporal, stable, physical, double-inventory, quiescent, receipt, and admission grades absent
  + [proof_route] public-surface static vocabulary and documentation nonclaim checks

& [M2B-SOTIDR-012] is zero effect and dependency delta
